e.\n\nWith that in mind, let's evaluate the truth value of each statement:\n\n- Statement $P$ is *false* because $\\sqrt{2}\\ne 1.$\n\n- Statement $Q$ is *true.* Indeed, ${3}^{2}=9.$\n\n- Statement $R$ is *true.* Indeed, $8$ is a composite number.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$P$ only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6ffec692-aff6-5f8a-8ed2-ad2d3be592a8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6ffec692-aff6-5f8a-8ed2-ad2d3be592a8" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ffec692-aff6-5f8a-8ed2-ad2d3be592a8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7f396bcf-805d-593a-bc0f-08d9c2160e96" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d9be00a6-31bb-5125-a45a-0d2e2a0dff31" "answer-7f396bcf-805d-593a-bc0f-08d9c2160e96" "answer-5e6e4243-4409-5270-8c34-d2a94fd272b4" "answer-2558bbfc-d47d-5f3f-915e-141d8043b721" "answer-10d4d128-cd47-51ad-8773-aed5b013eb3a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d9be00a6-31bb-5125-a45a-0d2e2a0dff31" :answer/id #uuid "d9be00a6-31bb-5125-a45a-0d2e2a0dff31" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$P$ and $Q$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7f396bcf-805d-593a-bc0f-08d9c2160e96" :answer/id #uuid "7f396bcf-805d-593a-bc0f-08d9c2160e96" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$P$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5e6e4243-4409-5270-8c34-d2a94fd272b4" :answer/id #uuid "5e6e4243-4409-5270-8c34-d2a94fd272b4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$Q$ and $R$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2558bbfc-d47d-5f3f-915e-141d8043b721" :answer/id #uuid "2558bbfc-d47d-5f3f-915e-141d8043b721" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$Q$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-10d4d128-cd47-51ad-8773-aed5b013eb3a" :answer/id #uuid "10d4d128-cd47-51ad-8773-aed5b013eb3a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None" :db/ensure [:answe